CQgosCiZjb20uY29udmVudGlvbi5iYXNlYmFsbC5iaW9sb2d5LnF1b3RlcxABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Smash Blast, a colorful and satisfying cannon-shooting game set in a lively carnival world!\\u003cbr\\u003eAim your cannon, launch the balls, and knock down every can on the platform. Each level gives you a limited number of shots, so choose your angle carefully and make every launch count.\\u003cbr\\u003eWatch stacked cans fall, collide, and scatter across the screen with satisfying effects. As you progress, you will encounter new layouts, larger structures, and fun challenges that test your aim and timing\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Simple one-touch aiming and shooting \\u003cbr\\u003e• Colorful carnival-themed environments\\u003cbr\\u003e• Satisfying can-smashing effects \\u003cbr\\u003e• Easy-to-understand level objectives \\u003cbr\\u003e• Limited-ball challenges that reward smart shots \\u003cbr\\u003e• A variety of can formations and stage layouts \\u003cbr\\u003e• In-game rewards earned through gameplay \\u003cbr\\u003e• Suitable for quick and relaxing play sessions\\u003cbr\\u003eSmash all the cans before you run out of balls and complete each challenge. Whether you play for a few minutes or continue through multiple levels, Smash Blast offers an easy and enjoyable shooting experience.\"],\"Devsimo\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NLYGMi5Zn7mw5PzHFXQ8CTCMkW1Lwhi60KR7GwgsweojTxZXtfbsB3BuqfQfDP0lJLD4mhEtHli0BoVqK1BdZw\"],null,[44,160,247,255]],null,[\"Everyone 10+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/csiz76udPjXmaJddU_1sanHGlQAAbKkvlprK3DSUNmwu1nY3U6qnXRrI2IDMaivooYK1x11oxz3PEO4z\"]],[null,\"Fantasy Violence, Mild Blood\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,nu