bilities.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ UNLIMITED DRESS UP\\u003cbr\\u003eNo limits, just pure fashion! Customize your dolls from scratch. Select different genders, diverse skin tones, glamorous makeup, and hundreds of clothing concepts. Style without boundaries and build a magnificent collection of unique dolls.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 CHOOSE LEFT OR RIGHT: THE STYLE DUEL!\\u003cbr\\u003ePut your style instincts to the test in our signature fashion battle! Go head-to-head against other players, let the system score your look, and see who claims the title of Style Queen or King!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚀Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e• No limits: Total freedom over gender, skin, and makeup 💄\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fun Left or Right decision-making gameplay 💖\\u003cbr\\u003e• A vast collection of styles to unlock and master 👗\\u003cbr\\u003e• Exciting automated scoring system to crown the winner 🏆\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and win the duel!\"],\"CozyTap Studio\",\"10,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VIHqAFmPoTSePQe9WorqXrvh81sfN9-C8pVeyTREqDV2Tk9hjAGkUBQN0tB50L6lh0cYIb8_FfUpO9C9QmnE\"],null,[247,179,235,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\