s them all, building a solid privacy barrier for your digital life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCore Features\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eApp Lock, Full Control  \\u003cbr\\u003e  Lock chat apps, social media, gallery, SMS, contacts, email, or any app you choose. No more worrying about others peeking into your private conversations and sensitive information.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChild Protection  \\u003cbr\\u003e  Prevent children from opening age‑inappropriate apps, safeguarding their mental well‑being.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLightweight \\u0026amp; Secure  \\u003cbr\\u003e  Small in size, stable in performance, and never spies on your privacy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUse Cases\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLending your phone to friends – Lock social apps and gallery, so they can’t browse around.  \\u003cbr\\u003ePreventing kids from misoperation – Lock games and system settings to avoid accidental downloads or unwanted spending.  \\u003cbr\\u003eProtecting financial privacy – Lock banking and payment apps to keep your funds safe from prying hands.  \\u003cbr\\u003eGuarding private content – Hide photos, videos, and chat history – keep them yours alone.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e---\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Privacy App Guard now and put a lock on your privacy!\"],\"Yongyou Trading Co\",\"50,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Q-mlLhFGDcwU_qf2PSabgR4zYbn_z6KQ6d3hDgwXXLZEw7p9YVfTKc5TUiyggI_mm9GMtioq_iEND_49BTS9wmg\"],null,[7,182,129,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or 