thod of preparation and story!\\u003cbr\\u003eQuest Challenges: Assist other tourists with their food requests to unlock more recipes and travel destinations!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSocial Interaction and Sharing\\u003cbr\\u003eGlobal Food Community: Meet friends from around the world in \\u0026quot;Tasty Travels\\u0026quot;, share your culinary adventures, and earn their admiration!\\u003cbr\\u003eRecipe Sharing: Exchange recipes, jointly appreciate the beauty of food, making your travel more colorful and diverse!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTravel Destinations\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock New Locations: Collect coins to unlock new travel destinations!\\u003cbr\\u003eWorld\\u0026#39;s Famous Culinary Cities: Explore and experience dozens of the world\\u0026#39;s famous culinary cities, each with its unique flavor and culture!\"],\"Century Games PTE. LTD.\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/W6HK6kBNU5u3L-SCl64Zmnt2jM3Dd-_95DtfhSc0eMN8o-r54ZzVXzm6t8LRLXbjm5JXhr3vxRYTkmvdLYQmdRI\"],null,[61,131,97,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Mild Language\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fatmerge.global\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fatmerge.global\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerI