i.ytimg.com/vi/xEyTjSZyvqg/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Join your Facebook friends and millions of players around the world for prize-winning spins as you build village after village on your journey to the top!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you have what it takes to be the next Coin Master?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGet ready to team up with friends for thrilling expeditions or join forces with a crew of fellow players. You’ll always find a new adventure with an ever-changing lineup of special events, packed with unique challenges and exciting surprises to keep you on your toes!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSpin and Attack!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSpin the wheel to discover your fortune- or attack friends\\u0026#39; villages and steal their coins to help build your own! You can also win gold sacks to build magnificent villages throughout the game and advance through thousands of levels. Don\\u0026#39;t forget to win shields from the wheel too—you\\u0026#39;ll need them to guard your village from other players trying to attack you back! Become the Coin Master with the most impressive villages and the most incredible prizes!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEmbark on Fun Expeditions with Friends!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEarning coins from the prize wheel isn’t the only way to gather resources—you can find them on exciting expeditions too! Team up with friends to journey to other villages and uncover treasures that will help you build and advance to the next level. You never know what wonders you\\u0026#39;ll find in the next world you explore!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect all the Cards!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIt\\u0026#39;s not always about the coins; it\\u0026#39;s about the treasure too! Collecting cards completes sets and unlocks the next village in your grand adventure. With thousands of villages to create and build, each completed set is a step forward in your journey. With every village you master, your wins will be even greater.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay and Create Teams with Friends!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTrade your cards with our online community to collect them all! Join our fast-growing interactive Facebook community to meet new friends, create your dream team, earn big rewards, and trade treasures to help each other build and progress faster!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCoin Master is free on all devices with in-app purchases\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCoin Master is intended for amusement purposes only and does not offer ‘real money’ gambling, or an opportunity to win real money or real prizes based on game play. \\u003cbr\\u003eCoin Master does not require payment to download and play, but it also allows you to purchase virtual items with real money inside the game. You can disable in-app purchases in your device’s settings.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow Coin Master on Facebook and Instagram for exclusive offers and bonuses!\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: facebook.com/coinmaster\\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram: instagram.com/coinmasterofficial/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://static.moonactive.net/legal/terms.html?lang\\u003den\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Notice: https://static.moonactive.net/legal/privacy.html?lang\\u003den\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eQuestions about the game? Our support is ready and waiting at:  https://support.coinmastergame.com/\"],\"Moon Active\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9WuR6JQH_xLNI0XlbYk_h2Oj4BJhAlU6phDNQtW3Rp4QpWcVlqV7R0SDr4kppvLh-foxUx8hIU_PnE60vKc4cw\"],null,[5,135,228,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Simulated Gambling\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.moonactive.coinmaster\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.moonactive.coinmaster\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.49 - $374.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.arrowswishwin.aethernova\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IfpJ-KyW1q3--RXTJz-OgrNfBnrVoDqWddG8uzW8vD0XVB2YabCll0JDL2KlTwKZA01ZKDCJBuy73FpauJTD_D4\"],null,[253,235,199,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/h_02rTPumjnT69OWVOmxvK69RBLEyy2lznRAwADh_h9sQnw8dWpCiVnN3GhuDcI-6rslJxQFCivJD4pZElDQ0g\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wzNuQS4eNHePEMDRIfxbUhC-AnRKdux93ocJ9H5_W4Kl0rPo7CLh4BKQP__vrccWN1ByYidHlygYuZOc7so81rI\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LjrHanNccTOJcnPPvj6Nex3hTvtd4RHp4DbdQ4Lfcbq0B6le2vj7bIkZuz7AO2Wr11eXtZ5_pUwFWP_W9ioqDO4\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pbicKvwQHq1TgDjJOYuuDKrW9Y7yuSsdSSbLcHnYbbWLEHa0erSk5CjCaQQhFFZyEzoEEacE6Azu5ow7wchXXg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MdKz8lXG7-_4tn23PlCAcf4YQ9iOPZ3tPqw42q4RGXZpVLY6_ugVgZ8haNQ1uXT2aBDxnV49kzjOhV2gTsX1eQ\"]]],\"Arrow Smash: Earn Cash\",[\"4.3\",4.3358207],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.arrowswishwin.aethernova\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.arrowswishwin.aethernova\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.arrowswishwin.aethernova\"]],[\"qgJmGmQIFkoTCOji0LLHkJcDFfP2PAId7Fkoq/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOAoiChxjb20uYXJyb3dzd2lzaHdpbi5hZXRoZXJub3ZhEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Arrow Smash: Earn Cash, the minimalist puzzle game where logic, precision, and careful planning are your only tools. Every level presents a grid filled with arrows – your task is to extract them all, one by one, without ever causing a collision. It sounds simple, but each move matters. One wrong step and you lose a heart! Solve puzzles, earn rewards, and watch your cash grow.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGameplay Overview:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach puzzle presents you with a grid of colorful arrows pointing in different directions. To solve the puzzle, you must tap and extract each arrow in the correct order, ensuring that no two arrows collide along their paths. As you progress, the grids grow larger, the paths become more complex, and your planning skills are pushed to the limit. Every successful clear earns you rewards – the smarter you play, the more you earn!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple Yet Deep Mechanics: Easy to understand, but increasingly challenging to master. Every level requires careful thought and strategic sequencing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEarn Real Cash: Solve puzzles and complete challenges to unlock real cash rewards. The more levels you clear, the more you earn!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThousands of Handcrafted Levels: Each level is meticulously designed to offer a unique challenge. With thousands of puzzles to solve, you\\u0026#39;ll never run out of brain-teasing fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMinimalist \\u0026amp; Clean Design: A distraction-free visual style that lets you focus entirely on the puzzle. Beautiful colors and smooth animations make every move a pleasure.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRelaxing, No-Pressure Gameplay: No timers, no rushing, no stress. Play at your own pace and enjoy the satisfaction of solving each puzzle.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHint System: Stuck on a tough level? Use hints to get a gentle nudge in the right direction and keep progressing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHeart System: You start each puzzle with a set of hearts. Make a mistake and lose one – clear the grid without losing them all to achieve a perfect victory and bigger rewards!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for Quick Sessions or Long Play: Whether you have five minutes or an hour, Arrow Smash: Earn Cash fits your schedule.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy You\\u0026#39;ll Love It:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eArrow Smash: Earn Cash is the perfect game for players who love to exercise their brain without the pressure of timers or fast reflexes. It\\u0026#39;s just you, the grid, and the satisfying challenge of finding the perfect sequence. Every solved puzzle brings a sense of accomplishment and real rewards – and every mistake teaches you to plan better. It\\u0026#39;s calm, it\\u0026#39;s clever, and it\\u0026#39;s completely addictive.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and see if you can clear the grid without losing a single heart – and start earning today!\"],\"PT ANUGRAH KERTAS UTAMA\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MbqTX2czxWSYEriLOyk8g6AbRHtzzpADoJomw_q-p3Ke7T6StS-4RpeatteL4x0u5onPSzY629NgkMc6gVCs\"],null,[69,48,34,25