gx753bi0\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uCrzFUQ-ROrCCZEfXOzarWFVLTR-3GpAu0hz0s6PRZsM4mDpVD3e80Z_cf9NXu9eJfS4-cr2aXDVUR2DQVNX7Gs\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5p5qmKKB_q4czZ8iAekNcAnBH8nKTdhRovx0ACDmwPN8rccnTAH2gWeMCBKgjANDb3jfVVbi5UOw2k4qSAgMNvw\"]]],\"My Talking Tom Friends\",[\"4.3\",4.284921],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends\"]],[\"qgJxGm8IK0oTCOji0LLHkJcDFfP2PAId7Fkoq/oBFwoVCIz149/mtPyOQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugI7CiUKH2NvbS5vdXRmaXQ3Lm15dGFsa2luZ3RvbWZyaWVuZHMQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Join Talking Tom, Angela, Hank, Ginger, Ben, and Becca in the most exciting virtual pet adventure! Dive into a world of cool animals and endless fun! Visit their house and see why they are the ultimate pet friends!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHere\\u0026#39;s why you\\u0026#39;ll love playing with them:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Take Care of All Six Friends: Interact with your favorite characters in one house! Feed, bathe, dress, and put them to sleep. Talk, play, and engage with Tom, Angela, Hank, Ginger, Ben, and Becca. Each character has their unique personality and needs.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Design and Create Stories: Bring all your characters together to create and share fun stories. Your imagination is the limit!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Creative and Sporty Activities: From gardening to chilling in the pool and playing musical instruments, there\\u0026#39;s always something fun to do.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Closet Full of Fun Fashions: Dress up your friends in the latest styles. Unlock new outfits daily and show off your fashion sense!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- House Customization: Decorate and upgrade their house to make it the coolest home in town. Collect tokens and rewards to enhance your living space.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Mini Games: Enjoy a variety of mini-games, from puzzles to action-packed challenges. There\\u0026#39;s something for everyone!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Collect Stickers and Rewards: Complete your sticker album to earn special rewards and unlock whacky food items. Feed your virtual friends and watch their hilarious reactions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Daily Trips to Town: Travel to different locations to shop for exciting new items and bring back surprises.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom Outfit7, creators of My Talking Tom, My Talking Tom 2 and My Talking Angela 2.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app contains:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Promotion of Outfit7\\u0026#39;s products and advertising;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Links that direct customers to Outfit7’s websites and other apps;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Personalization of content to encourage users to play the app again;\\u003cbr\\u003e- YouTube integration to allow users to watch videos of Outfit7\\u0026#39;s animated characters;\\u003cbr\\u003e- The option to make in-app purchases;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Subscriptions which automatically renew at the end of a subscription period unless cancelled. You can manage and cancel your subscription any time via Settings in your Google Play account;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Items to purchase (available in different prices) using virtual currency, depending on the player’s progress;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Alternative options to access all functionalities of the app without making any in-app purchases using real money.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of use: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/eula/en/\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy policy for games: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/privacy-policy-games/en\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomer support: support@outfit7.com\"],\"Outfit7 Limited\",\"500,000,000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Lno1-AvKmhMbYT1t-mmo0zUs_rVAC79YEQRQrptWdSiabjzRb0BD8vPZmPzMn-XfKQ89shlz1SrOcV8Ff87f\"],null,[55,161,252,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Comic Mischief\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.gimica.ballbounce\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/at5C9RVx1WjfKeVpcfBv-RsA5SZlRYNGIXiTTC3Bz_rhUwP0bTKCMvhS3gQuZGng_GV5WYfrcDhln2HVAxUWzw\"],null,[27,30,50,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gFO952wmu9cbnC1rQXItfbNupK8BpH4Vwd_sEKTVfJV7_QnsctySiFG1dyjOaV5PBocXdIy6oqEkpnWy9vHfdog\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/e1ySIzInTCjzNXIXmHXBQcJgcjiDkJQBSyCKZndtc12-Y97wIpliTCYA2BGDq6nZiWPkhzWHJWnad3LLqzahsA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/o4zam2XPHDwHkAWzWR4P2v_G6Mdy3IP781KpfTsHpmU3QFPIPacvas5NR0e_CcwmRQSP2QN3IAPW6TEVnT3JAg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yJivLcXTFUBdoxMYD_jWoTsF0tnzo6jgzyiGXbuXlkNid6-OjR5IxYmXhw5DM7U5uioSBj_OoXg7KdDAIG2syw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/f5pFASjDe97bc_WHZmK-sQShT7Nfoz364KSf1hS6mE--tX5YGHAveo18S9DPye7rPFoeyvhxGDmNbieounJZ\"]]],\"Ball Bounce\",[\"4.5\",4.478018],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gimica.ballbounce\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.gimica.ballbounce\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gimica.ballbounce\"]],[\"qgJfGl0ILEoTCOji0LLHkJcDFfP2PAId7Fkoq/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMQobChVjb20uZ2ltaWNhLmJhbGxib3VuY2UQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Meet Ball Bounce - the brick breaker game that gets more satisfying the longer you play. Aim, shoot, and watch your volley ricochet across the board as number blocks crumble into dust. No complicated rules, no timers, no pressure: just clean physics, smart angles, and that “one more shot” feeling.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMORE BALLS, MORE POWER\\u003cbr\\u003eIn many bricks-and-balls games, you worry about losing the ball. Here you don’t. Your arsenal only grows. Hit the white bonus balls hidden between blocks to collect them. Every ball you catch joins your next launch automatically. The more balls you build up, the faster you chew through tougher bricks and the bigger your clears become. Start with a small shot and build it into a bouncing storm that covers the whole board.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHOW TO PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003e- Tap-Hold-Swipe to aim, release to shoot\\u003cbr\\u003e- Break numbered bricks by hitting them repeatedly\\u003cbr\\u003e- Collect white balls to increase your next volley\\u003cbr\\u003e- Choose angles that keep balls bouncing longer\\u003cbr\\u003e- Clear as many blocks as you can and push your best score\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eENDLESS, RELAXING PROGRESSION\\u003cbr\\u003eEach round is a fresh puzzle: pick the perfect line, create long bounces, and let dozens (or hundreds!) of balls rain across the screen. As blocks get stronger, your growing ball count becomes the key strategy - build momentum, keep the board under control, and enjoy the satisfying cascade of hits and chain reactions. Play for a quick break, or settle in for a longer run and see how far your aim can take you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWHY YOU’LL LOVE BALL BOUNCE\\u003cbr\\u003e- Simple, addictive brick-breaking gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e- You never “lose” balls - you collect and stack them\\u003cbr\\u003e- Easy to learn, surprisingly strategic to master\\u003cbr\\u003e- Smooth controls and satisfying ricochets every shot\\u003cbr\\u003e- Pure score-chasing fun with endless replay value\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to turn one ball into an unstoppable volley? Ball Bounce is all about stacking shots and smashing through bricks as your growing volley tears tougher blocks apart.\"],\"Gimica GmbH\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2wUunpQk5IFPRpwLa2655XU_M1z-mDHhlZvlZZmypjIp_Imdg-julK0ChNKMC0KS_ynBdwz0Wx45nuT3iZc4\"],null,[10,20,42,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[