e/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.sprank.horror.beats.studio.battle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.sprank.horror.beats.studio.battle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.sprank.horror.beats.studio.battle\"]],[\"qgJvGm0IN0oTCOji0LLHkJcDFfP2PAId7Fkoq/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQQorCiVjb20uc3ByYW5rLmhvcnJvci5iZWF0cy5zdHVkaW8uYmF0dGxlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Monster Studio: Music Beats - Unleash Your Inner Music Maestro! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDive into the vibrant world of Monster Studio: Music Beats, a captivating mobile game where music creation is at your fingertips! Collect adorable Monster characters, each possessing unique and quirky sounds, and combine their individual beats to compose your own catchy tunes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn Monster Studio: Music Beats, you\\u0026#39;re the conductor of your own musical orchestra. Experiment with different Monster combinations to discover surprising harmonies and create original music that\\u0026#39;s as unique as you are. From playful melodies to energetic rhythms, the possibilities are endless!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e    Collect adorable Monster: Discover a diverse cast of Monster characters, each with their own distinct sound. Collect them all and unlock their musical potential!\\u003cbr\\u003e    Create Unique Music: Combine Monster beats to craft original songs. Experiment with different combinations and discover surprising musical creations.\\u003cbr\\u003e    Regular Music Updates: Enjoy a constantly expanding library of new music and Monster characters. There\\u0026#39;s always fresh inspiration waiting to be discovered!\\u003cbr\\u003e    Intuitive Gameplay: Monster Studio: Music Beats is easy to pick up and play, making it perfect for music lovers of all ages.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMonster Studio: Music Beats is the perfect game for anyone who loves music and creativity. Unleash your inner music maestro and start creating amazing beats today! Download Monster Studio: Music Beats now and let the music play!\"],\"Tappy Game\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XMWSk119-SY4Nr0Y0wPlL7QeP0LUpO0UhjrwZLyjJ6FIUmrGZaQsuPjemAmA3OldHqhKSbeWNmU2BXUwGkbR7BQ\"],null,[3,233,254,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.sprank.horror.beats.studio.battle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.sprank.horror.beats.studio.battle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$29.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.monster.blockcrusher\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9jgUc9msJyE9MhSwQLaeCmOKhpwVNzvaVL7pPp