6rdid\\u003dcom.findpath.puzzlearrow\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.findpath.puzzlearrow\"]],[\"qgJiGmAIO0oTCOji0LLHkJcDFfP2PAId7Fkoq/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNAoeChhjb20uZmluZHBhdGgucHV6emxlYXJyb3cQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Find the Path: Arrow Clues is a home screen launcher with a built-in puzzle game. It helps make your phone feel cleaner and easier to use, while also giving you a calm way to enjoy logic-based path puzzles. 🏠🧩\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith launcher tools such as icon shape options, theme colors, app drawer access, and quick app search, you can keep your home screen simple and easier to manage. When you want a short break, you can open the puzzle mode and work through arrow clue boards at your own pace. 🔍\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn the game, each puzzle presents a board, a set of arrow clues, and one objective: find the correct path. The rules are easy to understand, but each level still asks you to observe carefully, think step by step, and choose the right direction. There are no fast reactions or complex controls involved. The experience is designed to feel clear, steady, and relaxing, making it a good fit for players who enjoy quiet puzzle solving and light mental activity. ➡️🧠\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMain Features\\u003cbr\\u003e• Icon shape options for a more personalized home screen style\\u003cbr\\u003e• Theme color settings for a cleaner launcher appearance\\u003cbr\\u003e• App drawer to keep all apps in one convenient place\\u003cbr\\u003e• Quick search to help you find apps faster\\u003cbr\\u003e• Built-in arrow clue puzzle game with simple rules\\u003cbr\\u003e• Logic-based pathfinding gameplay focused on observation and planning\\u003cbr\\u003e• Relaxed play sessions with no rushed pressure\\u003cbr\\u003e• Clean boards and easy-to-read puzzle layouts ✨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow It Works\\u003cbr\\u003eTo use the launcher features, set Find the Path: Arrow Clues as your default home screen app.\\u003cbr\\u003eYou can switch back to your previous launcher at any time through your device settings.\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app only changes the appearance and organization of your home screen. It does not change your personal files or other apps. ✅\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you have any questions, please check our FAQ here: https://www.dzrotgame.com/#faqcontent\"],\"DZROT GAME\",\"50,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/y-UzGoViZMnHTVtVCkeog3PFyxLqVDTF5oowWrTGoYLpr66YSgEoWgoW21ukw_3hkxDU9oVhxa7nzbiZDAR5uA\"],null,[246,243,234,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.findpath.puzzlearrow\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.findpath.puzzlearrow\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,nu