FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSatisfying ASMR Unboxing: Experience realistic sound effects—crisp plastic peeling, bamboo lid opening, and squishy squeezing sounds that bring instant relaxation!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e100+ Cute Squishies to Collect: Unbox dozens of kawaii dumpling characters across various fun themes and sets.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRarity System: Find Common, Rare, Epic, and Ultra-Rare Golden \\u0026amp; Rainbow Dumplings to complete your dream collection!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock Secret Dumplings: Complete full sets in your collector\\u0026#39;s book to reveal special hidden legendary characters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStress Relief \\u0026amp; Relaxing Gameplay: No timers, no pressure, and no stress—just pure, satisfying fun designed to help you unwind anytime.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVibrant \\u0026amp; Cute Graphics: Enjoy charming 3D stylized visual effects and satisfying pop-up animations.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 HOW TO PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePick a Box: Choose your favorite dumpling blind box or steamer basket.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnbox \\u0026amp; Reveal: Tap to peel the wrapper, open the lid, and reveal your surprise squishy toy!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePop \\u0026amp; Collect: Squeeze your new squishy to enjoy ASMR effects, then store it safely in your collection room!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to collect them all and reveal every hidden secret?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Download Surprise Dumpling: ASMR Box today and start your satisfying unboxing journey!\"],\"NAMIGAME\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IAJkFsjBaHGzMJRudfYLkazKweGU6pxZy-IpjgWJO_Yt8aE_cSGW52kU53oYRRKuky6KP7lv5E3hIXjCMfuWPw\"],null,[194,145,251,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3A