A1Nttff6Nh00UJunwrOS40irZ0VfoJMyOt9hn8Q\"]]],\"Crazy Joker\",[\"4.2\",4.221239],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.puzzlea18.puzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.puzzlea18.puzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.puzzlea18.puzzle\"]],[\"qgJeGlwIREoTCOji0LLHkJcDFfP2PAId7Fkoq/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMAoaChRjb20ucHV6emxlYTE4LnB1enpsZRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Crazy Joker, a memory puzzle game where you reveal hidden puzzle pieces, remember their positions, and rebuild the complete picture.\\u003cbr\\u003eEach level begins with a short preview of the full puzzle. After a few seconds, every piece is turned face down. Use your memory to reveal pieces and drag them into the correct positions.\\u003cbr\\u003eAs correctly matched neighboring pieces come together, they automatically connect into groups. Connected groups move together, helping you gradually restore the entire picture.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe game becomes more challenging as puzzle boards grow larger, requiring better memory and careful planning.\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures\\u003cbr\\u003e• Preview the puzzle before the challenge begins\\u003cbr\\u003e• Reveal hidden puzzle pieces\\u003cbr\\u003e• Drag and swap puzzle pieces\\u003cbr\\u003e• Automatically connect correctly matched pieces\\u003cbr\\u003e• Memory-based puzzle gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e• Smooth and simple controls\\u003cbr\\u003e• Increasing puzzle difficulty\\u003cbr\\u003e• Relaxing brain-training experience\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you remember every piece and complete the whole picture?\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Crazy Joker and enjoy a fun memory puzzle challenge!\"],\"Lingkar Nusantara Pers\",\"10,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[n