 you compete against \\u003cb\\u003ereal players at your skill level\\u003c/b\\u003e and earn real rewards ...all from your phone. Cash out via \\u003cb\\u003eAmazon Gift Cards\\u003c/b\\u003e or \\u003cb\\u003eBank Transfer\\u003c/b\\u003e whenever you\\u0026#39;re ready.\\u003cbr\\u003eNo subscriptions. No paywalls. No pay-to-win. Just fair games and real rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e⚔️ COMPETE AGAINST REAL PLAYERS\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery match in BackSpin is a real contest between two people. You both get the \\u003cb\\u003eexact same game setup\\u003c/b\\u003e — same starting layout, same pieces, same power-ups. The only difference is how you play.\\u003cbr\\u003eWe match you with players at your level, so every game feels fair and fun — whether you\\u0026#39;re just getting started or you\\u0026#39;ve been playing for months.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🎮 10+ GAMES TO CHOOSE FROM\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePick the games you enjoy most:\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 \\u003cb\\u003ePuzzle \\u0026amp; match\\u003c/b\\u003e — test your speed and focus\\u003cbr\\u003e🃏 \\u003cb\\u003eCard \\u0026amp; strategy\\u003c/b\\u003e — outsmart your opponent\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 \\u003cb\\u003eArcade \\u0026amp; casual\\u003c/b\\u003e — quick rounds, fast results\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 \\u003cb\\u003eTrivia \\u0026amp; word\\u003c/b\\u003e — show what you know\\u003cbr\\u003eNew games and events are added regularly. Play one favourite or try them all — it\\u0026#39;s up to you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e💰 EARN REWARDS, CASH OUT YOUR WAY\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay games, earn gems, and cash out. Simple.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eAmazon Gift Cards\\u003c/b\\u003e — delivered instantly in the app\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eBank Transfer\\u003c/b\\u003e — withdraw straight to your account\\u003cbr\\u003eNo hidden fees. You earn by playing — and you keep what you earn.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🏆 DAILY TOURNAMENTS \\u0026amp; LEAGUES\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBeyond 1v1 matches, BackSpin runs daily tournaments, weekly leagues, and seasonal events. Climb the rankings, build your streak, and compete for bigger rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003eThere\\u0026#39;s always something to play — whether you have 5 minutes or an hour.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🔒 FAIR PLAY, ALWAYS\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBackSpin is built on fairness. Both players in every match receive the \\u003cb\\u003eexact same game conditions\\u003c/b\\u003e — like two dart players throwing at the same board from the same distance. No randomness, no advantages you can buy. Just skill.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e✅ WHY PLAYERS CHOOSE BACKSPIN\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eReal competition\\u003c/b\\u003e — play against actual people, not bots\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eSame game for both players\\u003c/b\\u003e — identical conditions, every match\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eMatched to your level\\u003c/b\\u003e — fair opponents, fair results\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCash out your way\\u003c/b\\u003e — Amazon Gift Cards or Bank Transfer\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e10+ free games\\u003c/b\\u003e — puzzle, card, arcade, trivia and more\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eNo deposits needed\\u003c/b\\u003e — play for free, earn for real\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eDaily tournaments\\u003c/b\\u003e — fresh competitions every day\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eNo hidden fees\\u003c/b\\u003e — ever\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e📥 GET STARTED\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload BackSpin Games. Pick a game. Enter a match. Beat your opponent. Cash out. Simple as that.\\u003cbr\\u003e💌 Need help? support@backspingames.com\\u003cbr\\u003e🌐 backspingames.com\\u003cbr\\u003e📱 Follow us on Instagram and TikTok\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ci\\u003eBackSpin Games is a skill-based gaming platform. All competitions are decided by how you play, not by chance. What you earn depends on your results and how much you play. Backspin Games IS NOT a gambling or betting platform.\\u003c/i\\u003e\"],\"Backspin Games SL\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Z4zJzqyv9PntzMVJHE9IrwNfCpza66Gs5eAYqN8aKbsa3g5VV9_mB9kss3DVBKFXnK7h9T4_fra79ee7UvBf4w\"],null,[52,30,153,255]],null,[\"Mature 17+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YX4IU7qLML-be7Xl25J-YkRBNgSZhVhJIsxeLdke3SaX1QBSFEKLbdcWORAwahq0oI4rrjz5YnWiVdb5\"]],[null,\"Cash Rewards\"],[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8TmeYqtEq_9kcV2_pw_YXR9bvGw0PJI_H67wFyWIKepZ2vzD0nib786iY3ypWcbVxxRqmeaMObMh-sMf\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.backspingames.backspin\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.backspingames.backspin\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.liquid.vial.game\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/d5GjJXswtKuRJ7c8j8ClImBKp38OPxAQ06WhI75c3gOtjapR9j0SvCfxcsHfMfPDH7T7tqdI9XrPrKEo73Oy6w\"],null,[234,186,166,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1922,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wd1NfYLiXyQ4qLeZMcFQ3PpEDXtvZCt2AMPvxR21wsq1eY4tqjBALoCzANNdhjcaiglSyzK81BsPMr37g-a-Tg\"]],[null,2,[1922,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9K36Lr1vZuxOOa8orTB-D7XxSNLzO0SEhttUXYlZ7_-Ugz_6Sq4fRZPNcG_aaNg0UgoookM58SSql9y5k8y-LA\"]],[null,2,[1922,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DHsPEVIZ4N4lcOdTUkyAiQbgmjWKf7QB5ryNF-jeNbQ_mMSGW3mF9mYSYdIuDadwUoagPfAg7zixjE7CY8_ZbQ\"]],[null,2,[1922,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eqGnKycGxvNtzU4NqgS8HCuCqjxg10U5ARWozurhW0w-U-tga9Mc7Mz3S42-M2Q-Pc-LrKcb8rtdY80BzMvw7A\"]],[null,2,[1922,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MHrXmMHjDGeqs4eredLUIab47mjo6JEpTf6_t3MxSB6BuosdaBqx4TFkRHEhJeO7QkJ1DAcbGJpYc_kccD6W\"]]],\"Liquid Vial\",[\"4.6\",4.5625],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.liquid.vial.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.liquid.vial.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.liquid.vial.game\"]],[\"qgJeGlwISkoTCOji0LLHkJcDFfP2PAId7Fkoq/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMAoaChRjb20ubGlxdWlkLnZpYWwuZ2FtZRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Liquid Vial is a calm, one-finger water sort puzzle. Each tap pours the top layer of one tube into another, and the goal never changes: end every tube holding one clean, single color. No timers, no lives, no punishment for thinking.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHOW TO PLAY • Tap one tube, then tap another to pour. • Pour onto an empty tube or onto the same color only. • Each tube holds four layers; a legal pour moves as much as fits. • Clear the level when every tube is a single pure color.\\u003cbr\\u003e3,500+ LEVELS, EVERY ONE VERIFIED • 3,586 main levels, each validated by our solver before it ships. • No repeated layouts — every board is normalized and de-duplicated. • Difficulty ramps from 2-4 colors in the first ten levels to 11-12 in the challenge range. • Every level is solvable. If you get stuck, the board is at fault, not you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHIDDEN COLORS Some tubes hide their true colors and show only what the top layer reveals; pour it out and what was buried appears. A simple sort becomes a test of memory and planning.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMORE WAYS TO PLAY • Winning Streak — chain clears to raise your multiplier and unlock chapters. One slip ends the run. • Daily Challenge — one fixed board for everyone, ranked by moves then time. •\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePLAY IT YOUR WAY • One hand, one finger, portrait. The rules take three seconds to learn. • The whole main line plays offline, anywhere. • Music, sound and vibration switch on and off separately. • Interstitial ads never appear in the first five levels and carry a daily cap. • Reward ads are always your choice; skip them and nothing is lost.\"],\"juyi\",\"1,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DZf2_GglaJebRnuK-Y3AROj8sX2CiWjs5d5RLzmC3fwhXuo4iosgOVTw22jkKkVcBAcnh3a4s7d1wuaxxe3OWw\"],null,[12,43,99,255]],null,[\"Mature 17+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YX4IU7qLML-be7Xl25J-YkRBNgSZhVhJIsxeLdke3SaX1QBSFEKLbdcWORAwahq0oI4rrjz5YnWiVdb5\"]],[null,\"Sexual Content, Partial Nudity\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8TmeYqtEq_9kcV2_pw_YXR9bvGw0PJI_H67wFyWIKepZ2vzD0nib786iY3ypWcbVxxRqmeaMObMh-sMf\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.liquid.vial.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.liquid.vial.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $89.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.yarn.scapes.color.by.number.free.games\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SAtBopQVZZk04unWlRi2XB0EYaFDnozPd4A6ZSOGsTiVq5qijJD0p75Mjk10g3BJAp_f5W9cn6cT45wSKcFjE3k\"],null,[1,77,224,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BSDUWbgjZZ8H-jjtxsYJ9QbYp2U31ISbIuCeT6Cj2dI2yPTWxD9i3P9Aur6C-1prJZJWtBPpMUH1V--FzEKS\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iqIMtjnNNQvL6_YJtBKGzEj-vs1pZPTEdKYBdj5EZwgzIg5qajEDLu4Af-Tag_mbSqI4os4f_kGrnNBFH9OOOA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yuCz9EiaKu2tv-QmKyeR59Rz5dgHj-fzaBp_om-gW_SgxqhT2r99pSAAgHfYVShMerpAdHCyvK_mOXrWW6TFc20\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Synt94Cgq37uXqmptaplg6tX2SIibUwDSrGoZVXBVJLo0A4Ey7DYv5cZlQiauyuyCB1V2FKS3etGMlJkHdY_-g\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9QX_lNDGijxiz_GXYah16WtXLaiWyUaNz47btjRv5gK4Zn-ze061ppoeYXYcGD6lVfc70BvjS0Ksg9TH_8QbRQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zwJAMRcYg01Wei0Rm185HjdcIe3vbUl76gEW48t3eZfLjCXSODxCdiSCZzP_oY7D8iQazepwdUmb4PUuWxfVGw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nHzvDdqecenE7jDCD9BI2uM5ZbItzs27Lxw7_2XCtYHJdbqwUSbASdtGtUAOAzMDtuQrskwggFNLvRR6-R5FgQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dGEp39BRpmDWnRex3AM7y2jQNBsp6-0k0dQUzL21lsUVg2bTtVr_B8gYQ1GNhce0-fjbbm93SUAIlqbYPaJdxNk\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EnQGB1x1Lk3e7uF1bO9-PambnWOzwQbVEmzbu6m3Z5Y5TRaJiWadUG5rpbX1bkqwNeaePuESxP1KaJF_2QwGfA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pNe-Loguf_RWrSpCyIfQA2a5qx-LuPVOK9JHFnr_LsCDbSxfWLs9gFEQS9fHC4H1QmnMWdWtFdvyjvo-fDzxps8\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zwJAMRcYg01Wei0Rm185HjdcIe3vbUl76gEW48t3eZfLjCXSODxCdiSCZzP_oY7D8iQazepwdUmb4PUuWxfVGw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nHzvDdqecenE7jDCD9BI2uM5ZbItzs27Lxw7_2XCtYHJdbqwUSbASdtGtUAOAzMDtuQrskwggFNLvRR6-R5FgQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dGEp39BRpmDWnRex3AM7y2jQNBsp6-0k0dQUzL21lsUVg2bTtVr_B8gYQ1GNhce0-fjbbm93SUAIlqbYPaJdxNk\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EnQGB1x1Lk3e7uF1bO9-PambnWOzwQbVEmzbu6m3Z5Y5TRaJiWadUG5rpbX1bkqwNeaePuESxP1KaJF_2QwGfA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pNe-Loguf_RWrSpCyIfQA2a5qx-LuPVOK9JHFnr_LsCDbSxfWLs9gFEQS9fHC4H1QmnMWdWtFdvyjvo-fDzxps8\"]]],\"Yarnscapes: Color by Number\",[\"4.9\",4.8945146],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.yarn.scapes.color.by.number.free.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.yarn.scapes.color.by.number.free.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.yarn.scapes.color.by.number.free.games\"]],[\"qgJ0GnIIS0oTCOji0LLHkJcDFfP2PAId7Fkoq/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCRgowCipjb20ueWFybi5zY2FwZXMuY29sb3IuYnkubnVtYmVyLmZyZWUuZ2FtZXMQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🧶 Yarnscapes: Color by Number\\u003cbr\\u003eTap once—and every connected pixel bead snaps into place, lighting up a whole section with color. ✨\\u003cbr\\u003eNo slow, block-by-block coloring.\\u003cbr\\u003eNo repetitive tapping.\\u003cbr\\u003eYarnscapes reimagines classic color by number as soft, yarn-textured pixel bead art. Choose a number, tap a matching block, and watch an entire connected area fill at once.\\u003cbr\\u003eNo need to draw or paint every tiny square by hand. Just follow the numbers and enjoy the satisfying moment when a whole patch falls perfectly into place. 🎨\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 One Tap. One Whole Area.\\u003cbr\\u003eTransform a simple numbered grid into soft, colorful pixel art.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Choose a color from the numbered palette\\u003cbr\\u003e• Find a pixel block with the matching number\\u003cbr\\u003e• Tap once to fill every connected block\\u003cbr\\u003e• Watch yarn-textured pixel beads land together\\u003cbr\\u003e• Complete one color and continue with the next\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery tap creates clear progress. Instead of filling a single square, you complete an entire connected section and reveal more of the picture at once.\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom the first number to the final bead, vivid colors and cozy yarn textures gradually come together in one satisfying artwork. 🧶\\u003cbr\\u003e🖼️ Explore Nine Colorful Categories\\u003cbr\\u003eOpen the coloring book and discover yarn-textured pictures across nine different themes:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Cute Art 🧸 — Sweet characters and playful designs\\u003cbr\\u003e• Animals 🐾 — Adorable pets and charming creatures\\u003cbr\\u003e• Objects 🪴 — Colorful items from everyday life\\u003cbr\\u003e• Nature 🌿 — Plants, landscapes, and natural beauty\\u003cbr\\u003e• Festivals 🎉 — Festive scenes and joyful celebrations\\u003cbr\\u003e• Emoji 😊 — Playful expressions and different emotions\\u003cbr\\u003e• People 👩 — Characters, portraits, and personal styles\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fantasy 🦄 — Magical creatures and imaginative scenes\\u003cbr\\u003e• Houses 🏡 — Cozy homes and colorful buildings\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom familiar objects and adorable animals to fantasy worlds and cozy houses, each category offers something different to discover.\\u003cbr\\u003eChoose a picture, follow the numbers, and turn its pixel grid into soft, colorful yarn art.\\u003cbr\\u003e📅 Relax and Color Every Day\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit the Daily page and enjoy more color by numbers challenges at your own pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Complete today’s featured picture\\u003cbr\\u003e• Revisit pictures from previous dates\\u003cbr\\u003e• Build your own colorful pixel art calendar\\u003cbr\\u003e• Zoom in to complete smaller spaces\\u003cbr\\u003e• Use hints to find hidden blocks\\u003cbr\\u003e• Enjoy coloring with no timers or pressure\\u003cbr\\u003e• Save your progress and continue anytime\\u003cbr\\u003eStart a picture, pause whenever you need, and return exactly where you left off. Every completed daily challenge adds another colorful yarn artwork to your collection.\\u003cbr\\u003eLove Jewelscapes, jewel-inspired art, casual pixel games, or relaxing adult coloring? Yarnscapes brings you a softer way to color by numbers.\\u003cbr\\u003eOne tap fills a whole area.\\u003cbr\\u003eOne completed number reveals more of the picture.\\u003cbr\\u003ePicture by picture, build a collection of soft and colorful yarn scapes. ✨\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Yarnscapes for free, tap once, and feel your first whole section fall into place. 🧶🎨\"],\"LoveColoring Game\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VuntwrvU4C9R73cfubW8_0BzZ3i29he7-ZcHK8fJBsNOgOVT6HelTMoU9a3bGQpjbk2vTvwg4h3ASAJBc1nP2g\"],null,[47,98,252,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.yarn.scapes.color.by.number.free.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.yarn.scapes.color.by.number.free.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$9.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.superplaystudios.dicedreams\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5MLgC2WWXcq1Pol8qRAXOKzIJY9qySkjF43DnWyd5F9fPj_heinHeIxvgIpPQwcaQ1w-mUzUmoP1Xeslf29irg\"],null,[53,201,254,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2688,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nGxDBKERWswITWcGRAGuTgWVsdS6jyVZHHGfGaByaBc7cOz6zxA6QozgXrIGI2g8E3eP7zAgMLaYrLy5iR7pcew\"]],[null,2,[2688,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Dtj5LnhXgzQdtfTYuztqm91VDvD6nxTyRXFSZ7h2A8_TqhHkLNqgJNQmnwOU6hpRxIOWR8vNCj_L3NyvrCI45A\"]],[null,2,[2688,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HYH6yH0eov-_XA-QdQ0lEEdBBJqdmn6qMAAAT02dnCu0Sik28aY8TOY5ToAvdQsC5XR9hyCsTJB8toouimga8UU\"]],[null,2,[2688,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0E7IokKbHs05SJuxWGhHjBEBa0pjFrQDG-FeThDp1lIvz6zk_NdRohMlsds-EiAu-wu682grL_Yo6x2uwsgDiDQ\"]],[null,2,[2688,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sXV036fbJ1lwoV3Yf5DYpPLDU2fp-qp_T9eq