HS6KX7BRDwdWL7CertLAoeDvOj2CoFWbQqH-DVSa22uq7aoO1j73XQ57UlPG_GoM_DMIgUcjioSCy6G8R8Huc5X9o1b0aM_aEc9UgXgU5UNtyWPzUwaWV1-zA8zrXCslz7IcMOqA3bAH2XF7EuQdoCndk0N5K4i80ksImxpmDvNERgdNK2nVLJr9D7ExK3R3Fj8qus9gwiyrFvP78NW1j7y-L_5RVYzuodmHvTOggEf-XbP-GQlevVFfsJ5vihR-Bt5u-GPh0Fttaw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/noS0nBihBpk/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Embark on a heartwarming journey through everyday life with Home Pin 4: Pull the Pin. This engaging pull-pin puzzle game offers a unique blend of captivating storytelling and challenging gameplay. As you solve each pin puzzle, you\\u0026#39;ll uncover intriguing stories filled with drama, humor, and relatable characters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHOW TO PLAY:\\u003cbr\\u003e● Pull the pin bars properly to solve the puzzle\\u003cbr\\u003e● You will lose the level if you make a wrong move\\u003cbr\\u003e● Use the money you earn to create your own home by unlocking new furniture and rooms.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFEATURES:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Engaging storytelling: Experience a variety of heartwarming and dramatic stories that will keep you hooked.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Challenging puzzles: Test your problem-solving skills with a wide range of pull-pin puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Beautiful graphics: Enjoy visually stunning environments and characters that bring the stories to life.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Intuitive gameplay: Easy-to-learn controls make it simple to pick up and play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Home Pin 4: Pull the Pin today and immerse yourself in a world of captivating stories and addictive gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003eHaving a problem? Don\\u0026#39;t worry. Contact us via email: help@gameestudio.com\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit our Facebook page: https://www.facebook.com/gameeglobal\"],\"Gamee Global\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SG8WJbxtvKZxIuJLdAmA7urIZSjk3vMqdPtytx3M0CrHw8PWIl0UNndX0qf