LFT6WBl29pYbiaHgi12pQPWw_t4gXtl3WG_o9l9hT_hLcdPnV_sFR7UkuB8g0V3L-BLP4WJI89KZTOqCZ\"]]],\"Mystery Dumpling Glitter Unbox\",[\"4.7\",4.73],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.hp.mystery.dumpling.glitter.unbox\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.hp.mystery.dumpling.glitter.unbox\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.hp.mystery.dumpling.glitter.unbox\"]],[\"qgJvGm0IVkoTCOji0LLHkJcDFfP2PAId7Fkoq/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQQorCiVjb20uaHAubXlzdGVyeS5kdW1wbGluZy5nbGl0dGVyLnVuYm94EAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Mystery Dumpling Glitter Unbox, the cutest mystery unboxing and ASMR collecting game! 🥟✨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePeel, unwrap, and open adorable dumpling boxes to reveal the surprise inside. Every unboxing brings a new dumpling, with different rarities, cute designs, and satisfying reveal effects waiting to be discovered.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect them all and complete your Dumpling Collection! From Common and Rare dumplings to Epic, Legendary, Rainbow, and Golden Dumplings, you never know what you\\u0026#39;ll find next.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🥟 Unbox Cute Mystery Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003eOpen mystery boxes one by one and enjoy the anticipation of every reveal. Peel the wrapper, open the bamboo steamer, and discover your next adorable dumpling!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Collect \\u0026amp; Complete\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild your collection with dumplings of different rarities:\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Common Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e💎 Rare Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Epic Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e👑 Legendary Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Rainbow Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Golden Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Secret Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you collect every dumpling and unlock the rarest surprises?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💖 Relaxing ASMR Experience\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy satisfying unboxing sounds, cute animations, glittery effects, and relaxing reveal moments. Every box is designed to make collecting feel fun, cozy, and satisfying.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Discover Every Mystery\\u003cbr\\u003eEach collection has its own theme and hidden surprises. Complete collections to unlock exclusive Secret Dumplings and discover all the special characters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e🥟 Satisfying mystery dumpling unboxing\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Open mystery boxes and reveal surprises\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Cute glitter effects and satisfying animations\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Find Rainbow \\u0026amp; Golden Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Collect dumplings from Common to Legendary\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 Complete collections and unlock Secret Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e💖 Relaxing ASMR gameplay for a cozy experience\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnwrap, collect, and discover! Start your Mystery Dumpling Glitter Unbox journey and see if you can find every cute, rare, and secret dumpling! 🥟✨\"],\"HIGAME Studio\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RGt1LOG9Ie0JdveYEOqZ3EjLS2xyTV1qQezOtMATXOl2HbXN3pVbsQrDDUeuyMhqV7gjWRkcPCjo_BQnXk_S\"],null,[218,100,246,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt5