lh.googleusercontent.com/k2fM7sm968CDFJqnFt_CeTTYG0QkIURbrzF3oMZIKXbBXlIYq6z4I374cNvrsyKZ4Meml2N3hu00zBv68bgxcg\"]],[null,2,[2340,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OfQ43cV4We5jawVbEs5OAceGNOJdryi6gnFdknO4UZxPAQKN-DoGs4oUsLMgPJ2M29uc-1VHFcXDmiZIW_0k0NY\"]],[null,2,[2340,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0cIjOmtyEBLdkjO01qp78wlhBDuMs-kCYLQXueufbizDaH3tRR2n-_dkgTzxvyFGBfTJ8YNEKc81WmfBeKPj2w\"]],[null,2,[2340,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/k2fM7sm968CDFJqnFt_CeTTYG0QkIURbrzF3oMZIKXbBXlIYq6z4I374cNvrsyKZ4Meml2N3hu00zBv68bgxcg\"]],[null,2,[2340,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dZvE92rkyl52183eyAps5JDyG29U2RoXlx7M2F5mRwX-oF9H8kfgvhdbz7hgJ_sk3x0b4tvJVTcB_EywjZ91gQ\"]],[null,2,[2340,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OfQ43cV4We5jawVbEs5OAceGNOJdryi6gnFdknO4UZxPAQKN-DoGs4oUsLMgPJ2M29uc-1VHFcXDmiZIW_0k0NY\"]]],\"Sparrow Mahjong\",[\"3.8\",3.8],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.goodday.goodmahjong\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.goodday.goodmahjong\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.goodday.goodmahjong\"]],[\"qgJhGl8IV0oTCOji0LLHkJcDFfP2PAId7Fkoq/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMwodChdjb20uZ29vZGRheS5nb29kbWFoam9uZxABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Sparrow Mahjong, a relaxing tile-matching puzzle where every move brings you closer to victory.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimply find two identical mahjong tiles and tap to match them. Clear every tile on the board to complete the level and unlock the next challenge. With simple controls and satisfying gameplay, Sparrow Mahjong is easy to learn and fun to master.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🀄 Classic Mahjong Matching\\u003cbr\\u003e·Match two identical mahjong tiles.\\u003cbr\\u003e·Clear the entire board to complete each level.\\u003cbr\\u003e·Simple rules with endless puzzle fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 Hundreds of Challenging Levels\\u003cbr\\u003e·Progress through carefully designed stages.\\u003cbr\\u003e·Enjoy increasingly interesting tile layouts.\\u003cbr\\u003e·Test your observation and matching skills.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💡 Helpful Boosters\\u003cbr\\u003e·Hint reveals a matching pair when you\\u0026#39;re stuck.\\u003cbr\\u003e·Refresh shuffles the remaining tiles to create new opportunities.\\u003cbr\\u003e·Keep your puzzle journey smooth and enjoyable.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌿 Relax Anytime\\u003cbr\\u003e·Clean visuals and comfortable game play.\\u003cbr\\u003e·Play at your own pace with no time pressure.\\u003cbr\\u003e·Perfect for quick breaks or long relaxing sessions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;re a longtime mahjong fan or new to tile-matching games, Sparrow Mahjong offers a satisfying puzzle experience that\\u0026#39;s easy to pick up and hard to put down.\"],\"AAKATTUGAMES\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kX2VCKn-6tiOoYCiQC9qiJKclJxjYY3FFAe-Dm0ahKIySJ8dIVUcmqqVPcTdmLCSf3UzivN5cL2cV9JxIyYn\"],null,[122,209,227,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTC