ace opens up again.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔲 The right color is not enough — the shape has to fit.\\u003cbr\\u003eLook at the open cells, count what is left, and save room for the block you will need next.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ When the last grain is gone, the picture disappears and a new one goes up.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple, but you keep going. Pick, place, repeat.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ HIGHLIGHTS\\u003cbr\\u003e👆 One-tap controls — pick, place, done.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Color matching — each block only absorbs its own color.\\u003cbr\\u003e🔲 Space management — the color can match and the shape still won\\u0026#39;t fit.\\u003cbr\\u003e💯 Fill meter — see how full every block is at a glance.\\u003cbr\\u003e🖼️ Sand pictures — a new one on the wall every stage.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧰 Items — stuck? Hammer, magnet, vacuum.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 Made for people who like block puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe picture is up. So, where does this one go?\"],\"Stormborn Inc.\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WJ6zlxh6QzFKdhufynQFkgEbgo_0yoOfMaj1lXtDfToGdHzr-eMpvP0cGZvLP1yNHbKTVhj8OGA3Ihfs7kG3\"],null,[103,201,253,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"U